title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/Mann_der_Arbeit.jpg
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Outside of electoral politics, the KPD runs a network of unofficial organizations built to expand their base of support.

= Party Organizations

For the radicalized masses, the KPD serves as an alternative to bourgeois society, offering community, discipline, and aid to its members.

- @newspapers: Fund our media apparatus and hire journalists
- @welfare:  Fund Rote Hilfe, our mutual aid organization.
- @culture: Fund sports leagues, educational, and cultural programs.
- @rfb: Fund the Rotfrontkampfersbund, our paramilitary organization.
- @youth: Support the KJVD, our youth wing, to radicalize future generations.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

# TODO: differing outcomes based on whether you've seen media, and what kind of media you've supported.


@welfare
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_kpd += 5*(1 - dissent);

We have increased funding to Rote Hilfe. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@culture
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; cultural_organizations += 1; thalmannites_dissent -= 6; conciliators_dissent -= 6; labor_wing_dissent -= 6; ultras_dissent -= 6; socialism += 2

It is not enough for the KPD to solely be a political party. Marxistische Arbeiterschule and numerous hiking clubs are foundational to the political education and leisure of our members. Funding these organizations makes our members more committed to the party, even when our policies might not be to their liking.

[? if sa_strength > 500 : However, it feels frivolous to spend on sports and choirs when the fascists are murdering us in the streets. ?]

@rfb
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rfb_strength  += 100; rfb_militancy += 0.01; reichsbanner_timer = 0; funded_reichsbanner += 1

We have increased recruiting to the Rotfrontkampfersbund.

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rfb_strength += 50; rfb_militancy += 0.02; young_socialists += 1; thalmannites_strength += 5; ultras_strength += 5; radicalization += 1;

Our new youth members flock to the ultras or thalmannites of the party, and also bring new radicalism to the RFB.

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
